a (asinh) só para exibição, para comparar valores de ordens de grandeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos fundos (0,59%).&#10;Um valor por fundo: a classe/série com mais meses publicados, na versão mais recente do informe (a mesma do gráfico ao lado).&#10;\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade × fundos FIDC</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rentabilidade mensal entre os fundos FIDC\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"41.6\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"4.4\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"45.6\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"0.4\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"31.1\" y=\"44.8\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"1.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"44.4\" y=\"44.2\" width=\"12.0\" height=\"1.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"57.6\" y=\"42.8\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"3.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"70.8\" y=\"44.6\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.4\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"84.1\" y=\"44.2\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"1.8\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"97.3\" y=\"43.4\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"2.6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"123.8\" y=\"42.6\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"3.4\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"137.1\" y=\"33.1\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"12.9\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"150.3\" y=\"28.3\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"17.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"163.6\" y=\"37.3\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"8.7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"176.8\" y=\"41.4\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"4.6\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"190.1\" y=\"42.8\" width=\"12.1\" height=\"3.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"203.3\" y=\"41.8\" widt